[length:04:13]
[ti:Tiny soldier]
[ar:Aracne Phobia]
[al:EP 1 - The Doll's Vault]
[au:Aracne Phobia]
[lr:Aracne Phobia]
[by:Azaria]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.2.7]
[00:01.04]Ha… ha…
[00:04.42]he walks in straight lines…
[00:08.49]like something drew him that way…
[00:24.84]He stands so still
[00:26.31]like nothing leaks
[00:28.11]like all his cracks
[00:29.70]are underneath
[00:31.53]He says “it’s fine”
[00:32.52]he says “it holds”
[00:35.06]but I can hear
[00:36.04]the way it folds
[00:38.72]He looks like code
[00:40.45]that doesn’t crash
[00:42.14]just loops the pain
[00:43.86]and clears the cache
[00:46.48]Behavior stable
[00:47.60]Emotional load contained
[00:50.06]Command integrity
[00:51.32]Successfully maintained
[00:53.28]No visible error
[00:54.86]No system distress
[00:56.84]Subject displays
[00:57.99]Operational success
[00:59.99]If that’s “perfect”
[01:01.95]I don’t want it
[01:03.48]If that’s “strong”
[01:04.82]I’ll break upon it
[01:07.27]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[01:10.83]tiny soldier, ticking clock
[01:14.57]Say the line, don’t feel a thing
[01:18.14]good boy built for everything
[01:21.63]If he breaks, he won’t be loud
[01:24.78]systems fail but make no sound
[01:28.54]Is that strength or just decay?
[01:31.91]Paint it clean and call it “okay”
[01:36.19]He sees the fire
[01:37.45]and calls it risk
[01:39.50]I see a pulse
[01:40.77]he wants dismissed
[01:42.22]But sometimes he…
[01:44.52]lags behind
[01:45.67]like something else
[01:47.33]is on his mind
[01:49.20]Wet pavement steps
[01:50.12]repeat, repeat
[01:50.92]a word he says
[01:51.80]I cannot read
[01:53.25]“Korzet”… again
[01:56.45]and then it’s gone
[01:57.02]like foreign code
[01:57.91]he’s running on
[01:58.84]His hands go still
[01:59.73]like they remember
[02:01.54]something warm
[02:02.39]inside the pressure
[02:03.57]Like holding shape
[02:05.19]that isn’t here
[02:07.06]like fitting worlds
[02:08.93]inside a sphere
[02:11.21]Emotional deviation
[02:12.99]Leads to system collapse
[02:14.96]Impulse behavior
[02:15.89]Increases critical gaps
[02:18.57]Discipline ensures
[02:19.71]Collective survival
[02:21.31]Attachment risks
[02:22.94]Structural denial
[02:24.67]You call it balance
[02:26.24]I call it fear
[02:27.72]You call it duty
[02:29.77]I disappear
[02:32.38]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[02:35.52]tiny soldier, perfect cog
[02:39.16]Hold the line until he drops
[02:42.71]no one asks what it cost
[02:46.31]If I felt like that inside
[02:49.45]I’d tear the system open wide
[02:53.24]Better broken, better loud
[02:56.60]than disappearing in a crowd
[03:03.94]Stability—
[03:05.67]control—
[03:07.21]maintain—
[03:09.17]mai—
[03:14.78]What if he doesn’t know
[03:17.87]he’s already gone
[03:21.41]What if “being strong”
[03:24.43]is just… staying wrong
[03:28.74]Wind him up, he’ll never stop
[03:32.16]tiny soldier, hollow core
[03:35.74]Built to hold but not to want
[03:39.12]not to feel, not anymore
[03:42.87]If that’s what you call alive
[03:46.08]I refuse to be that kind
[03:49.75]Let it glitch, let it break
[03:53.13]I choose every wrong I make
[03:56.99]♫
[04:00.48]System… stable…
[04:04.08]system… st—
[04:07.65]♫
